DESCRIPTION:World Kindness Day is observed on November 13 by the World Kind
 ness Movement\, the international NGO that created it and launched it on t
 hat date in 1998. It is one of the few observances of its kind with a trac
 eable founding organization and a documented start\, and the movement's ow
 n account is unusually specific about both. What it asks for is deliberate
 ly unstructured: do something kind\, and let it count.\n\nhttps://todaycel
 ebrates.com/holiday/world-kindness-day/
